# Optional and PAID. A key alone spends nothing: `npm run ingest` only asks Meshy
# (https://www.meshy.ai) for a textured 3D model when you pass --mesh (or --remesh). It then
# builds the model from up to four reference photos (multi-image-to-3D) and stores it, slimmed
# for the web, as public/items/<id>/model.glb. Each model costs credits and takes a few minutes.
# Plain ingest and paste-to-ingest in `npm run dev` always make fully offline image-based assets.
MESHY_API_KEY=
